    "phone": "Desktop Rotate 30, phone 45, Reset gives 0 on the phone, not desktop's 30. Same for Scale Y (desktop 80, phone gives 100) and Offset X (desktop 10, phone gives 0). Desktop keeps its values. So Reset writes the default as the phone's own value.",
    "animationTab": "An Animation tab field acts as a Design field. At default: opacity 0, no pointer, focused or not. Off default and focused: opacity 1, on top. Blurred, hovered or not: opacity 1, pointer none, not on top.",
